flowchart TD
    A[Patch job discovery<br/>docs/_aiops/patch_jobs/*.md] --> B[Backlog scan aiops:backlog]
    B --> C[Load per-job metadata<br/>{jobId}.meta.json]
    C --> D{Job locked?}
    D -- Yes and no --force --> E[Skip<br/>locked (manual review)]
    D -- No or --force --> F[Run OllamaPatchRunner]
    F --> G{Diff validation}
    G -- success --> H[Write diff/json outputs]
    H --> I[Commit + PR metadata check/stub]
    G -- failed_invalid_diff --> J[Persist raw response<br/>docs/_aiops/debug/{jobId}.last-response.txt]
    J --> K{jobId == README?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Set manual_docs_review + lock<br/>write README.pr.json]
    K -- No --> M{attempts >= 2?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Lock job<br/>manual review required]
    M -- No --> O[Eligible for future retry]
    N --> P[Manual unlock path]
    L --> P
    P --> Q[aiops:unlock {jobId}<br/>locked=false, attempts=0]
